            "review_title": "Review at Emme Cocktail Bar",
            "review_text": "Anneli B\nMalmö, Sweden289 contributions\n0\nRomantic urban cool bar\nMar 2026 • Couples\nCoolest bar! Up the stairs and there is a small restaurant and bar that you absolutely do not expect. A special place with local young and trendy audiences. A little over- cool but humble bartenders who mixed fun and different drinks. Romantic music and atmosphere. Go here!\nTranslated from Swedish\nShow original\nWritten March 15, 2026",
