            "review_title": "Review at Emme Cocktail Bar",
            "review_text": "H888\nHong Kong, China688 contributions\n0\nYes. Amazingly good. Hidden gem style speakeasy\nFeb 2025 • Couples\nYep. It’s cool, fabulous and hidden. All the right elements for a speakeasy. Unlike some speakeasy around town, this one is riskily located inside a genuine apartment building. So the neighbors are tolerant to a point. And please respect the need for quiet when exiting. But that’s what makes Emme such a great spot. Oh that and the fabulous cocktails and young mixing staff who are creative, fun and proving loads of energy to this chill out spot. See the photos of others and below as a hint of headways to find this hidden gem. A seat overlooking the road is a pleasant way to while away an hour with a cocktail in hand\nRead more\nWritten February 20, 2025",
